  "idea": "How to schedule emails to send at a later date and time automatically",
  "text": "The simple email automation feature every beginner should use for important client messages. You finish writing updates at odd hours, but hitting send immediately signals chaotic working habits. Misaligned delivery times trigger off-hour pings from anxious clients and lower your reply rates. Click the dropdown next to the Send button in Gmail and schedule delivery for normal working hours. Your messages always arrive at the perfect moment.",
